{"key":"apphy2-mcq-030","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"zero","working":"In an RC series circuit connected to a DC battery of voltage V, the current as a function of time is given by I(t) = (V/R) * exp(-t / (RC)). As time t becomes very large (t >> RC), the capacitor charges fully until the potential difference across it equals the battery's emf. At this steady state, no additional charge can flow onto the capacitor plates, and the current decays exponentially to zero.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":355,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":355,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":322,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":128,"reasoningTokens":194},"totalTokens":677,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":194,"promptTokenCount":355,"candidatesTokenCount":128,"totalTokenCount":677,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":355}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":128}]},"reasoningTokens":194,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":5600,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"apphy2-mcq-030","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"zero","working":"In a series RC circuit connected to a DC source, the capacitor charges until the potential difference across it equals the battery voltage. The charging current is initially battery voltage divided by R, but it decays exponentially. After a very long time, the capacitor is fully charged, so the voltage across the resistor is zero. By Ohm’s law, with zero voltage across the resistor, the current in the series circuit is zero. Thus the steady-state current is zero.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":412,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":28,"cacheReadTokens":384},"outputTokens":347,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":123,"reasoningTokens":224},"totalTokens":759,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":412,"completion_tokens":347,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":28,"total_tokens":759,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":224}},"reasoningTokens":224,"cachedInputTokens":384},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3996,"keyed_label":"B"}
